'''Sushi Cat''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.5 Update|Version 2.0.5]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 6.4 Update|Version 6.4]] doubles its health. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 8.2 Update|Version 8.2]]. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], Sushi Cat is unlockable in the Rare Cat Capsule after clearing [[Saudi Arabia (Empire of Cats)|Saudi Arabia]].

